  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Encouraging behavioral changes of citizens for improving waste management practice in the Prespa Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;specific objective(s) &lt;/strong&gt;of this call for proposals is: to develop a waste management communication programme for improving waste management practices in Prespa region&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The priority(ies) of this call for proposals are: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#xb7;Public awareness for proper waste management; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;Education on sustainable waste management practices; &lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
